[00:26.04]Jehovah anointed his Son
[00:29.70]To rule over ev’ryone.
[00:35.82]His throne is established on justice,
[00:40.68]That God’s will on earth may be done.
[00:45.91](Chorus)
[00:46.06]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed.
[00:51.24]Praise Jesus, O you faithful sheep,
[00:56.00]Who loyally follow day after day
[01:01.05]and all his commandments keep.
[01:06.56]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed,
[01:11.11]the Ruler of heavenly fame,
[01:16.72]Anointed with exultation and might
[01:22.04]to honor God’s holy name.
[01:45.30]Christ’s brothers are chosen and called.
[01:49.42]God gives them their own new birth.
[01:55.12]This bride class will share in the Kingdom
[01:59.08]And bring Paradise to this earth.
[02:05.06](Chorus)
[02:05.21]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed.
[02:10.38]Praise Jesus, O you faithful sheep,
[02:15.18]Who loyally follow day after day
[02:20.28]and all his commandments keep.
[02:25.68]Praise Jah for his Son, the Anointed,
[02:30.60]the Ruler of heavenly fame,
[02:35.44]Anointed with exultation and might
[02:41.17]to honor God’s holy name.
